      "y": 180,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 1540,
      "text": "```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    thesis(\"ADR-000 · three-leg thesis\")\n    leg1[\"LEG 1 · output\"]\n    leg2[\"LEG 2 · context object\"]\n    leg3[\"LEG 3 · interface surface\"]\n    producers[\"7 producers → .canvas\"]\n    loader[\"canvas_context loader · L1–L7\"]\n    surface[\"InteractionSurface · 5 primitives\"]\n    std([\"canvas_std · immutable substrate\"])\n    adr007{\"adr_007 · bounded firewall touch\"}\n    reconcile[\"reconcile() · advisory reverse\"]\n    draft(\"_draft + requires_review\")\n    human{\"explicit human promotion\"}\n    source((\".lattice.yaml · authoritative\"))\n    thesis --> leg1\n    thesis --> leg2\n    thesis --> leg3\n    leg1 -->|Palette| producers\n    leg2 -->|Salon| loader\n    leg3 -->|Armature| surface\n    producers -->|installed dep| std\n    loader -->|read-only (pythonpath)| std\n    surface -->|has-a ContextGraph| loader\n    adr007 -->|the only authorized touch| std\n    surface -->|act| reconcile\n    reconcile --> draft\n    reconcile -->|READS ONLY — never writes| source\n    draft --> human\n    human -->|promotion (explicit)| source\n```"
    }
  ],
